text:
{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 23 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D11"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the carboplatin shortage on 2023-04-28 and it remains Current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E32", "D12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Accord Healthcare Inc. is listed on the FDA shortage list with package NDC 16729-295-12.",
      "cites": ["E22"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Accord product label names Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited as the manufacturing plant (FEI 3004011473).",
      "cites": ["E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1191818 of Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited ended 2022-12-02 and was classified OAI; the classification letter is dated 2023-04-05, 23 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E17", "D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An import alert 66-40 for Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited was published 2023-06-01, 34 days after the posting, and a Warning Letter was issued 2023-07-28, 91 days after the posting.",
      "cites": ["D8", "D9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our Corvale East and Corvale Lakeside sites both stock Teva-labeled carboplatin 10 mg/mL 60 mL vials (NDC 00703423901) manufactured by PHARMACHEMIE BV.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E6", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked transfer option is to move 3 vials of 10 mg/mL 60 mL from Corvale East (15 days on hand) to Corvale Lakeside (1.5 days on hand), which would give Lakeside 4 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3", "D13"]
    }
  ]
}
